      "uid": "zhcn:eaf349ea8d35fb7c8406524f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我们的水平差得实在太远了。\n杏目耀眼到让我不禁产生了这种想法。",
      "source_fingerprint": "60c6884a597ac194507ed9860be8c907b992cef915d4b200adb4b68e8ba7f262",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
