      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "嘿，拿了第1名的那个孩子不错嘛。是想当短距离赛马娘吗。\n我一会去跟她搭个话试试看。",
      "source_fingerprint": "884539277bca069778f5e3ff62ecd0a154106a2a0865eb447681f3d082659e8b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
