      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "回国后，我又过上了往常的日子。为了寻找担当赛马娘，\n我到处观看模拟赛，参观教官的训练——",
      "source_fingerprint": "0605161ed68038910e12b4377d5f172fa99774b75bfa92341432217c7925a95a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
